<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    <title>Convite para Equipa: {{eventName}}</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#eef1f8;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#eef1f8">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px;">
          <table role="presentation" width="520" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:520px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px 32px 0 32px;">
                <img src="https://bafatorio-public-assets.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/brand/bafatorio.png" alt="Bafatório" width="176" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:176px;max-width:60%;" />
                <div style="border-bottom:2px solid #2d57f4;margin-top:18px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:22px 32px 30px 32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1f33;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;">Olá {{participantName}},</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">Foste convidado(a) para te juntares à equipa de gestão do evento <strong>{{eventName}}</strong>, com o cargo de <strong>{{role}}</strong>.</p>
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 22px 0;">
                  <tr>
                    <td bgcolor="#eef1f8" style="border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1f33;line-height:1.9;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6478;">Detalhes do evento</p>
                      <strong>Data:</strong> {{eventDate}}<br />
                      {{#if eventLocation}}
                      <strong>Local:</strong> {{eventLocation}}<br />
                      {{/if}}
                      <strong>Organizador:</strong> {{eventManagerName}}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Para aceitares o convite e começares a colaborar:</p>
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#2d57f4" style="border-radius:10px;">
                      <a href="{{invitationLink}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">Aceitar convite</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5b6478;">Se o botão não funcionar, copia e cola este link no navegador:<br /><a href="{{invitationLink}}" style="color:#2d57f4;word-break:break-all;">{{invitationLink}}</a></p>
                <p style="margin:24px 0 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e7eaf3;font-size:11.5px;color:#5b6478;">Enviado por {{eventManagerName}} através do Bafatório · Mensagem automática. Não responder.</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
